# Scattered-read candidate (io-screen 2026-10-06): German labels of all scholarly articles (Q13442814; long titles).
# No VALUES: one P+O bound class scan (wdt:P31 wd:Q13442814), then the German
# label scan. German literals are in the external (on-disk) vocabulary.
# A sparse class spreads its label IDs over the sorted vocabulary, so few
# reads share a page. Public endpoint count (2026-10): ~0.26M German labels.
PREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>
PREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>

CONSTRUCT { ?entity rdfs:label ?label }
WHERE {
  ?entity wdt:P31 wd:Q13442814 .
  ?entity rdfs:label ?label .
  FILTER(LANG(?label) = "de")
}
